# Copy to .dev.vars for `npm run dev`. Dev auth signs you in as a local owner without GitHub.
AUTH_MODE=dev
SESSION_SECRET=replace-with-32-or-more-random-characters-for-local-use
# The locally served public site (tools/serve-pages.mjs) is a second browser origin.
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=http://localhost:8080
# Optional: a fine-grained PAT with contents:read on vault-private so embedded documents load.
# GITHUB_DOCS_TOKEN=
# Cloud experiment generation. Unset = the offline template generator (no cost, no network).
# To generate on your Claude subscription with no API key, run ~/src/claude-bridge (uv run bridge.py)
# and point the Worker at it — the key is a dummy the bridge ignores:
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=bridge
# ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8788
# Or use a real key against Anthropic directly (leave ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL unset):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5
